       <p class=\"faq-a\">The building and the interiors are designed together, so room sizes, windows, lighting and furniture fit each other and changes during construction are fewer.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Build Once, Build Right</h2>\n            <p>A house in Karnal is usually built to last for generations. Thoughtful architecture services make sure it stays comfortable, strong and easy to maintain over all those years.</p><p>Have a plot in Karnal? <a href=\"/karnal/contact\">Discuss it with 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}